Bug type: out-of-bounds-read
CWE: CWE-125
Explanation: In the '%' branch, the code unconditionally reads urn[1] and urn[2] to match escape sequences without verifying the string has at least two more characters. Inputs ending with an incomplete percent-encoding (e.g., "urn:publicid:%" or "%2") cause reads past the string terminator.

